# The runner family (runner/ — laptop daemon, ACP client, menubar, EC2 runner) is
# NOT a dependency of the web image (canopy-web depends only on canopy-agent-runs +
# canopy-cron) and no app imports it. Excluding it from the build context means
# editing the runner never busts the expensive `uv pip install` layer — the web
# image rebuilds only when the web app actually changes. deploy/ is likewise
# runtime-irrelevant to the container.
runner
deploy

# The SDK's own dev env (created by `uv run` in sdk/python). The image installs
# the package from source; a host-built venv must not ride into the context.
sdk/python/.venv
